071 Participants
* Initiated HAART according to current DHHS guidelines (CD4+ T cells \ 350 cells/mm3 at week 24 on HAART; measurement to be collected from clinical care results contained in the medical record at the clinical site within +/- 30 days of week 24 on therapy; and
