* NYHA class II-IV;
* LVEF \ =130ms.

Exclusion Criteria:

* moderate-to-severe aortic stenosis;
* frequent premature ventricular complexes;
* signiﬁcant peripheral vascular disease.

Key Inclusion Criteria:

